WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
So I've been working with Sam for a bit now, and honestly he's been great, super helpful.

00:07.000 --> 00:10.000
You know, I run a small business. It's just me.

00:10.000 --> 00:19.000
I'm not very up to date with technology, really. I just like to do the physical work.

00:19.000 --> 00:28.000
And he kind of sat down with me, explained CRMs, how they could actually help me.

00:28.000 --> 00:41.000
He showed me some ways to use AI to automate tasks in the background while I focus on more important things.

00:41.000 --> 00:47.000
He's given me unsolicited advice on website design.

00:47.000 --> 00:57.000
He's really good with all the tech, and he breaks it down in a way that just makes sense.

00:57.000 --> 01:03.000
If you own a small business and you're feeling like you're a little behind,

01:03.000 --> 01:08.300
I definitely recommend reaching out to Sam, for sure.
